rows=''.join('<tr><th>'+esc(label)+'</th>'+''.join(f'<td>{float(m[key])*scale:.{digits}f}{suffix}</td>' for m in metrics)+'</tr>' for label,key,scale,digits,suffix in [('ROC-AUC','ROC-AUC',1,4,''),('AP','Average Precision (AP)',1,4,''),('Accuracy','Accuracy',100,2,'%'),('Recall','Recall',100,2,'%'),('Precision','Precision',100,2,'%'),('Brier','Brier Score',1,4,''),('Log loss','Log Loss',1,4,'')])
page=r'''<!doctype html><html lang="ro"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Credit risk · Technical Q&amp;A</title><style>
:root{--ink:#17314b;--muted:#526478;--teal:#007e82;--line:#d7e2eb}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:100px}body{margin:0;background:#f5f7fa;color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.6 system-ui,Arial,sans-serif}header{background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:32px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2))}header h1{font-size:34px;line-height:1.2;margin:8px 0 16px}header p{max-width:930px;margin:0;color:#deebf4}.kicker{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9ddcdf}.controls{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 24px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}input[type=search]{padding:10px 14px;font:inherit;flex:1;min-width:200px;border:1px solid #8ba1b4;border-radius:5px}button,select{font:inherit;padding:9px;border:1px solid #8ba1b4;border-radius:5px;background:white;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}label{white-space:nowrap}button:hover{background:#e9f5f5}input:focus,button:focus,a:focus,select:focus{outline:3px solid #48bec2;outline-offset:2px}.layout{max-width:1230px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:26px}nav{position:sticky;top:155px;align-self:start}nav a{display:block;padding:9px 0;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}nav a:hover{color:var(--teal)}nav small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:22px}h2{font-size:27px;margin:35px 0 14px}h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.35;margin:6px 0 14px}.question,.quick{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:7px}.meta{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.05em}.short{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 18px}details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650;color:var(--teal)}details p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px}.where{font-size:14px;background:#edf6f6;padding:10px 12px;margin:18px 0 8px}.source{font-size:12px;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{color:#24688a}.quick h2{margin-top:0}.quick p{margin:8px 0}.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px}td,th{padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}th{font-weight:650}thead{background:#edf3f9}.empty{padding:30px;background:white}.count{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);min-width:105px}[hidden]{display:none!important}.note{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}footer{padding:30px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:850px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{position:static;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}nav small{display:none}.controls{position:static}.question{padding:18px}header h1{font-size:28px}}@media print{body{background:white;font-size:11pt}.controls,nav,.source{display:none}.layout{display:block;margin:0;padding:0}header{background:white;color:var(--ink);padding:0 0 20px}header p,.kicker{color:var(--muted)}.question{break-inside:avoid;border-radius:0;padding:12px}.question[hidden],.topic[hidden]{display:block!important}details{display:block}summary{display:none}h2{break-after:avoid}.quick{break-inside:avoid}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}footer{display:none}}
</style><header><div class="kicker">9 October 2026 · Andrei · suport pentru întrebări tehnice</div><h1>Credit risk: răspunsuri rapide pentru profesor</h1><p>Colegul prezintă. Tu explici indicatorii, metodele și limitele. Citește răspunsul scurt, apoi detaliul numai dacă întrebarea îl cere. Caută în română sau după termenii englezi din Explorer.</p></header><div class="controls"><input id="search" type="search" aria-label="Caută întrebări" placeholder="Caută: AUC, SHAP, bootstrap, leakage…"><select id="section" aria-label="Temă"><option value="">Toate temele</option>SECTION_OPTIONS</select><label><input type="checkbox" id="priority"> Prioritare</label><button id="reset">Reset</button><button id="expand">Deschide detaliile</button><button id="print">Print / PDF</button><span id="count" class="count" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="layout"><nav>NAV<small>Ctrl+F deschide detaliile și resetează filtrele pentru căutarea în pagină.<br><br>Tasta / activează căutarea.<br><br>Textul este salvat aici. Legăturile la surse cer structura proiectului.</small></nav><main><div class="quick" id="quick"><h2>Înainte de întâlnire: 5 lucruri de reținut</h2><p><strong>1.</strong> AUC/AP = ranking. Recall/precision = decizii la prag. Calibrare = sensul probabilităților.</p><p><strong>2.</strong> 81,8% accuracy coexistă cu 35% recall. Majoritatea nu are default.</p><p><strong>3.</strong> Gapurile sunt female−male. Pozitiv = default flag, nu aprobare.</p><p><strong>4.</strong> SAFE p este tail fraction. Semantic q controlează selecția și magnitudinea. Nu sunt stresuri echivalente.</p><p><strong>5.</strong> Intervalele sunt condiționate. Zero în IC nu dovedește fairness. Cadrul extins este propus.</p><h3>Cifrele de pe holdout</h3><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Metrică</th><th>LR</th><th>GBM</th></tr></thead><tbody>ROWS</tbody></table></div><p class="note">24.004 training / 5.996 holdout. 1.320 default-uri. Prag strict p&gt;0,50. Mai mic este mai bine pentru Brier și log loss.</p><p><strong>Formula de răspuns:</strong> ce măsoară → ce am făcut → ce observăm → ce nu putem concluziona.</p></div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden>Niciun rezultat. Încearcă un singur termen sau Reset.</div>CARDS<footer>Din rapoartele și tabelele salvate ale proiectului. Fără analize noi. Configurația din 9 octombrie 2026.</footer></main></div><script>
const search=document.querySelector('#search'),sec=document.querySelector('#section'),priority=document.querySelector('#priority'),questions=[...document.querySelectorAll('.question')];const norm=s=>s.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').toLowerCase();function filter(){let tokens=norm(search.value).trim().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean),n=0;for(const q of questions){const match=tokens.every(t=>norm(q.dataset.search).includes(t))&&(!sec.value||q.dataset.section===sec.value)&&(!priority.checked||q.dataset.priority==='true');q.hidden=!match;if(match){n++;if(tokens.length)q.querySelector('details').open=true;}}for(const s of document.querySelectorAll('.topic'))s.hidden=![...s.querySelectorAll('.question')].some(q=>!q.hidden);document.querySelector('#count').textContent=n+' / '+questions.length+' întrebări';document.querySelector('#empty').hidden=n>0;document.querySelector('#quick').hidden=!!(tokens.length||sec.value||priority.checked);}search.addEventListener('input',filter);sec.addEventListener('change',filter);priority.addEventListener('change',filter);function reset(){search.value='';sec.value='';priority.checked=false;filter();}document.querySelector('#reset').onclick=reset;document.querySelector('#expand').onclick=()=>{const ds=[...document.querySelectorAll('.question:not([hidden]) details')];const open=ds.some(d=>!d.open);ds.forEach(d=>d.open=open);document.querySelector('#expand').textContent=open?'Închide detaliile':'Deschide detaliile';};function all(){reset();document.querySelectorAll('details').forEach(d=>d.open=true);}document.querySelector('#print').onclick=()=>{all();window.print();};document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='f')all();if(e.key==='/'&&!['INPUT','SELECT','TEXTAREA'].includes(document.activeElement.tagName)){e.preventDefault();search.focus();}});window.addEventListener('beforeprint',all);filter();
</script></html>'''
